  "title": "Skillet Cornbread",
  "description": "This tasty skillet cornbread is simple to make with cornmeal, eggs, butter, milk, and a trusty cast iron skillet for a delicious side to any meal.",
  "authors": [
    "mjgreenaway"
  ],
  "date_published": "2015-11-19T02:14:58-05:00",
